      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了求出积 $xy$ 的界，我们应用关于两个不等式（各不等",
        "式的两边都是正数）两边分别相乘的定理：",
        "$\\begin{array}{c}2.5<x<2.6\\\\↵ 1.4<y<1.5\\\\\\hline↵ 2.5\\cdot1.4<xy<2.6\\cdot1.5\\end{array}$",
        "即 $3.5<xy<3.9$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了求两个数 $x$ 与 $y$ 的商的界，我们把分式 $\\frac{x}{y}$ 写成积的",
        "形式：",
        "$\\frac{x}{y}=x\\cdot\\frac{1}{y}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "首先求式 $\\frac{1}{y}$ 的界。因为",
        "$1.4<y<1.5$，所以 $\\frac{1}{1.4}>\\frac{1}{y}>\\frac{1}{1.5}$，",
        "或者换一种写法：",
        "$\\frac{1}{1.5}<\\frac{1}{y}<\\frac{1}{1.4}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在可以把关于不等式两边分别相乘的定理应用于不等",
        "式",
        "$2.5<x<2.6$ 与 $\\frac{1}{1.5}<\\frac{1}{y}<\\frac{1}{1.4}$，",
        "得：",
        "$\\begin{array}{c}2.5<x<2.6\\\\↵ \\frac{1}{1.5}<\\frac{1}{y}<\\frac{1}{1.4}\\\\\\hline↵ 2.5\\times\\frac{1}{1.5}<x\\cdot\\frac{1}{y}<2.6\\times\\frac{1}{1.4},\\end{array}$"
      ]
    },
    {
